1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,910
Gordon Ramsay's Hell's Kitchen is inside this Las Vegas hotel.

2
00:00:03,960 --> 00:00:07,205
It serves lunch and dinner, and it is open daily.

3
00:00:07,255 --> 00:00:10,860
And that is one of twenty restaurants at Caesars Palace.

4
00:00:10,910 --> 00:00:14,175
There are also twelve bars and lounges, and three coffee shops.

5
00:00:14,225 --> 00:00:17,540
Breakfast is cooked to order, seven to eleven every morning.

6
00:00:17,590 --> 00:00:20,675
Add seven outdoor pools and eight hot tubs.

7
00:00:20,725 --> 00:00:23,400
A spa with forty-eight treatment rooms.

8
00:00:23,450 --> 00:00:26,300
And the Colosseum theater, just two minutes away on foot.

9
00:00:26,350 --> 00:00:30,410
The full tour is on my channel.
